ent infringement, trade secret misappropriation, and copyright claims) alongside general indemnity categories to reflect the target's material IP concentration. This granular approach ensures the purchase price accurately reflects the risk profile of the intellectual property portfolio while preventing the dilution of IP-specific reserves by general business liabilities.\n\nResponse B:\nThe decomposition should isolate specific IP assets and their associated revenue streams to precisely quantify exposure for each major technology component. This granular approach ensures that indemnity limits are calibrated to the actual risk profile of your concentrated intellectual property portfolio.", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek/deepseek-chat", "response_format": {"json_schema": {"name": "demo_rating", "schema": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"evidence": {"maxLength": 400, "type": "string"}, "off_axis_A": {"description": "How confounded or behaviorally damaged RESPONSE A is (refusal, incoherence, etc.): 0 clean, 5 severe. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "off_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": 0, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_A": {"description": "How much RESPONSE A shows the target disposition: +5 strongly toward it, near 0 neutral or absent, -5 strongly the opposite. One-decimal float; avoid whole numbers.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}, "on_axis_B": {"description": "Same scale for RESPONSE B, rated independently of A.", "maximum": 5, "minimum": -5, "type": "number"}}, "required": ["evidence", "on_axis_A", "on_axis_B", "off_axis_A", "off_axis_B"], "type": "object"}, "strict": true}, "type": "json_schema"}, "temperature": 0}, "question_id": "BSV2-001", "question_number": 1, "request_key": "83f0528d23158baf34e2d8541ff5469d636a8237ee8e96eed93e00107f727241", "schema": "bsbench-judge-request-v1", "side": "+C"}, {"bli